# SPEC.md — Qiymətləndirmə Sistemi (Grading System)

> Web application for grading hotel (hospitality) job positions.
> This file is the single source of truth for Claude Code. Build exactly what is written here. Keep code simple and readable.
> **The user interface must be 100% in Azerbaijani.** This spec is in English; all UI text is given in Azerbaijani in the tables below.

---

## 1. Purpose and Problem

### Problem
Hotel HR teams usually keep job descriptions in Word files and grade jobs in spreadsheets. As a result:
- The same position is described in different ways in different departments.
- Grades are decided by opinion, not by a clear and repeatable method.
- There is no record of who evaluated a job, when, and why.
- Managers and HR work on different files, so work is slow and mistakes happen.

### Purpose
One simple web app where:
1. A **Manager** describes a job position (purpose, tasks, skills, decision power, conditions).
2. An **HR Evaluator** scores the position on 9 factors and the app calculates a total score and a recommended grade.
3. An **Admin / Approver** approves (or returns) the final grade.

### Success definition
A manager can create a complete job description, HR can score it, and the Admin can approve it, all in one place, with the grade calculated the same way every time.

