## 2. User Roles

Real login is **not** part of the MVP. A **role switcher** (dropdown in the header) lets the user pick a role. The chosen role is saved in `localStorage`. (Phase 2: Firebase Authentication.)

| Role (code) | UI name (Azerbaijani) | What they can do |
|---|---|---|
| `manager` | Menecer | Create positions, edit own **draft** or **returned** positions, submit for evaluation. Can view everything. Cannot score or approve. |
| `hr` | HR Qiymətləndirici | Everything a manager can, plus: fill Section 12 (scores, recommended grade, comments), send evaluation to approval, return a position to the manager. Cannot give final approval. |
| `admin` | Admin / Təsdiqləyici | Everything. Gives final approval or returns a position. Edits grade bands and factor weights. Loads sample data. |

### Permission table

| Action | Menecer | HR Qiymətləndirici | Admin |
|---|---|---|---|
| View positions and employees | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Create / edit position (Draft, Returned) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Submit position (Draft → Submitted) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Score position (Section 12) | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Send to approval | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Final approval / reject | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Edit weights and grade bands | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Load sample data | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |

Hide or disable buttons the current role is not allowed to use.

