## 6. Design

### Style
- Clean, calm, professional hotel look. **White background**, lots of whitespace.
- **Card-based** layout, rounded corners (12px), soft shadow, 1px light border.
- Two display modes for lists: **Card** (grid) and **List** (compact rows).
- **Mobile-first**: single column under 600px, 2 columns 600–899px, sidebar + 3 columns from 900px. Buttons at least 44px tall.

### Colors (CSS variables)

```css
:root {
  --bg: #FFFFFF;
  --surface: #FFFFFF;
  --surface-alt: #F4F7FA;
  --border: #DCE3EA;
  --text: #1B2430;
  --text-muted: #5B6776;
  --primary: #14376F;      /* main blue: buttons, header, active nav */
  --primary-text: #FFFFFF;
  --accent: #1A596A;       /* teal-blue: badges, progress, links, secondary buttons */
  --accent-text: #FFFFFF;
  --success: #1E7A4F;
  --warning: #A86400;
  --danger: #B3261E;
  --shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(20, 55, 111, 0.08);
}

/* Dark mode: applied by [data-theme="dark"] on <html>, and by system setting on first load */
[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg: #0E141C;
  --surface: #16202B;
  --surface-alt: #1C2835;
  --border: #2A3949;
  --text: #E8EEF5;
  --text-muted: #9AA8B8;
  --primary: #14376F;      /* keep brand blue for buttons */
  --primary-text: #FFFFFF;
  --accent: #1A596A;
  --accent-text: #FFFFFF;
  --link: #7FB1E8;         /* lighter blue for text/links on dark backgrounds */
  --shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
}
```
- In dark mode use a lighter tint (`--link`) for text links and active nav text so contrast stays readable (WCAG AA).
- Status badge colors: Qaralama = gray, Təqdim edilib = accent, Qiymətləndirilir = warning, Təsdiq gözləyir = primary, Təsdiqlənib = success, Geri qaytarılıb = danger.

### Typography
```css
font-family: "Hilton Sans", "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
```
- Hilton Sans is a licensed font and is not loaded from the internet. If the font files are supplied later, place them in `/fonts` and add `@font-face`. Until then, the fallback fonts are used. Do not add any other web font.
- Base size 16px. Headings: 600 weight. Page title 24px, card title 18px.
- Make sure Azerbaijani characters (ə, ı, ö, ü, ç, ş, ğ, İ) render correctly. Add `<meta charset="UTF-8">` and `<html lang="az">`.

### UI behavior
- Smooth but short transitions (≤ 200ms). Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Visible keyboard focus outline.
- Badges for status and grade; empty states with a short sentence.

