## 8. Acceptance Criteria (Testing Checklist)

### General
- [ ] The whole UI (menus, buttons, labels, errors, empty states, toasts) is in Azerbaijani. No English text is visible except job titles from the title list and the app works with `lang="az"`.
- [ ] Azerbaijani letters (ə, ı, ö, ü, ç, ş, ğ, İ) display correctly everywhere.
- [ ] App opens by double-clicking through a local server and works when deployed to Vercel with no build step.
- [ ] No console errors on normal use.

### Design
- [ ] Background is white in light mode; primary buttons use `#14376F`; accents use `#1A596A`.
- [ ] Font stack starts with "Hilton Sans" and falls back correctly.
- [ ] Light/Dark toggle works, is remembered after refresh, and follows system theme on first visit.
- [ ] Text is readable in both modes (no dark text on dark background).
- [ ] Layout is usable at 360px width (no horizontal scrolling); bottom navigation on mobile, sidebar on desktop.
- [ ] Position and employee lists switch between Card and List views.

### Roles
- [ ] Role switcher changes visible buttons immediately and persists after refresh.
- [ ] Menecer cannot see "Qiymətləndirməyə başla", "Təsdiq et" or Settings.
- [ ] HR Qiymətləndirici can score but cannot give final approval.
- [ ] Admin can approve/return and edit settings.

### Job titles and form
- [ ] The title picker contains all 15 departments and their titles from Section 11, and search works (e.g., typing "chef" shows chef titles).
- [ ] Selecting a title fills the department automatically.
- [ ] The form has 11 steps with a progress indicator; all fields from Section 5.3 exist with Azerbaijani labels.
- [ ] Required fields show "Bu xana mütləqdir." and block submission.
- [ ] User can add and remove multiple responsibility rows.
- [ ] Step 9 (people management) is hidden when job level is "İcraçı".
- [ ] "Qaradama kimi saxla" saves without full validation; "Təqdim et" requires all required fields.
- [ ] Saved data appears correctly in Firestore and on the detail screen.

### Grading
- [ ] Evaluation screen shows 9 factors with weights and the score guide.
- [ ] Total and recommended grade update live when a score changes.
- [ ] Test values: all scores = 5 → total 100 → G10; all scores = 1 → total 20 → G1; `pos3` scores → 67 → G6; `pos4` scores → 77 → G7.
- [ ] Cannot send to approval until all 9 scores are chosen.
- [ ] Changing the recommended grade manually requires a comment.
- [ ] Changing weights in Settings changes new calculations; saving is blocked if weights do not sum to 100.
- [ ] Band validation blocks gaps, overlaps, or ranges that do not start at 0 and end at 100.

### Workflow
- [ ] Status flow works: Qaralama → Təqdim edilib → Qiymətləndirilir → Təsdiq gözləyir → Təsdiqlənib.
- [ ] "Geri qaytar" asks for a reason, sets status to "Geri qaytarılıb", and the manager can edit and resubmit.
- [ ] Approved positions show final grade; a manager cannot edit them.
- [ ] Dashboard counts match the real data.

### Data and seed
- [ ] Admin can load seed data; 5 employees and 5 positions appear.
- [ ] Each employee opens the correct linked position and shows its grade badge.
- [ ] Empty database shows friendly empty states, not errors.
- [ ] If Firebase config is missing or Firestore fails, an Azerbaijani error message is shown.

